                "entry_id": "a66b2ccc-4ebd-36d8-b2a6-bc6490ea07c1",
                "word": "yeesh",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bf3e0c78-34bc-3878-b5e1-35a03e38c41e",
                        "entry_id": "a66b2ccc-4ebd-36d8-b2a6-bc6490ea07c1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Expressing exasperation or impatience."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe99d6f2-a9e8-47a0-aaae-4b9d97314c17",
                                "sense_id": "bf3e0c78-34bc-3878-b5e1-35a03e38c41e",
                                "text": "You ask..yeesh do we have to teach you EVERYTHING??"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0c2039b6-fc4c-41f0-b465-05c6f9e51e9b",
                                "sense_id": "bf3e0c78-34bc-3878-b5e1-35a03e38c41e",
                                "text": ">How can there be a \"best\" crime against humanity?\nOnes that get rid of the most undesirable ethnic groups. Yeesh do I have to draw a picture?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f88847fe-f775-4256-a746-75671a5e0360",
                                "sense_id": "bf3e0c78-34bc-3878-b5e1-35a03e38c41e",
                                "text": "Yeesh, pour salt on the wound, why don't you?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6e38d13-a02c-4868-9212-3d7e3bd8c19e",
                                "sense_id": "bf3e0c78-34bc-3878-b5e1-35a03e38c41e",
                                "text": "“I just wondered if you'd—” “Shut up, Shawna. I didn't say anything. Yeesh!”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2edfcfaa-f904-3e44-9da8-1b10a469fed9",
                        "entry_id": "a66b2ccc-4ebd-36d8-b2a6-bc6490ea07c1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Expressing relief; phew, whew."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "680374eb-4858-4b36-a0a5-bcbd959c88a8",
                                "sense_id": "2edfcfaa-f904-3e44-9da8-1b10a469fed9",
                                "text": "\"I guess that explains why they don't fly very well.\" Gina shuddered. \"And I almost made it crash! Yeesh!\" \"Yeesh is right,\" agreed Jay."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5724539-980f-4639-9263-d5c05fe56649",
                                "sense_id": "2edfcfaa-f904-3e44-9da8-1b10a469fed9",
                                "text": "\"Yeesh,\" Ratchet muttered again, caressing his singed whiskers. \"I think I'll let you look for the books from now on, Kendra.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3ba796cc-debf-3468-97bf-68957988abae",
                        "entry_id": "a66b2ccc-4ebd-36d8-b2a6-bc6490ea07c1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Expressing disgust; yuck, yech."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d819b783-2d79-4fbf-8f8c-4b6e92a6def9",
                                "sense_id": "3ba796cc-debf-3468-97bf-68957988abae",
                                "text": "And so, if your mother says, \"Yeesh!\" every time somebody mentions broiled liver..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e6276a5-10a6-4bc5-b001-781497226e48",
                                "sense_id": "3ba796cc-debf-3468-97bf-68957988abae",
                                "text": "Yeesh. So strong was his cologne she could practically taste it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "939efca3-62aa-42db-abec-536bf4dbca5d",
                                "sense_id": "3ba796cc-debf-3468-97bf-68957988abae",
                                "text": "She did, however, spot Gordon Burns over by the bar. Yeesh. He gave her the creeps."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
